ck adds to it)\n- `rig.sqV = 0`: its speed\n- `rig.t`: seconds of its own clock (idle breathing, blinks)\n- `rig.trail = []` †: recent points of the blade (or fist) tip, for the swing's smear\n- `rig.x = 0`, `rig.y = 0`, `rig.z = 0`: where its feet are (from the last update)\n- `E.MOVES: slash, backslash, overhead, rising, thrust, spin, plunge, twohand, jab, cross, hook, uppercut, haymaker, elbow, ... (24)`: a library of named attacks with timing and body motion (anticipation, lunge, step, twist, hop). new E.Attack('overhead'), new E.Attack('thrust', { reach: 10 }), new E.Combo(['jab', 'cross', 'hook', 'uppercut']) rig.update(dt, { ..., attack: E.move('roundhouse', .5)\n- `E.MOVES { a0, a1, z0, z1 }`: a0 / a1 angles (+ = the right side, or up in the screen plane), z0 / z1 heights\n- `E.MOVES { reach, r0, r1, hand, plane, blade }`: reach, or r0 / r1 (an extending thrust); hand: 'R' | 'L' | 'both', plane: 'side' (always vertical), blade: 0 (no trail)\n- `E.MOVES { wind, active, recover }`: the phases' seconds\n- `E.MOVES { kick, spin, lunge, hop, crouch, lean, twist, hold }`: the body's motion (kick: true swings the right foot)\n- `E.knockback(from, target, speed = 160, up = 0)`: push a target away from a point (attacker): uses target.push (E.Body) or its vx / vy. up = upward speed (knock into the air)\n- `E.move(name, u = .5, phase = 'active')`: any move from E.MOVES at any moment, for previews and cutscenes: rig.update(dt, { ..., attack: E.move('roundhouse', .5) }) (u 0..1 through phase)","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181307__x22cc1b/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BhBfoj1aKn9SfEgRZy2du3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
